{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is inscribed in a circle. The measure of the non-overlapping minor arcs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> are, respectively, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a7571e305196a92023acd0267f348a4b862766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+75^{\\circ} , 2x+25^{\\circ},3x-22^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"208\" height=\"16\" />. Then one interior angle of the triangle is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed9ec13d16ff7203c97c992fbe0c0d7c27f56278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 57\\tfrac{1}{2}^{\\circ}\\quad \\text{(B) } 59^{\\circ}\\quad \\text{(C) } 60^{\\circ}\\quad \\text{(D) } 61^{\\circ}\\quad \\text{(E) } 122^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"365\" height=\"22\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99d166be410eb459a9bb78d844882f75f7f99bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(circle((0,0),65)); draw((25,60)--(39,-52)--(-52,-39)--(25,60)); dot((25,60)); dot((39,-52)); dot((-52,-39)); dot((0,0)); draw((0,0)--(-52,-39)); draw((0,0)--(39,-52)); draw((0,0)--(25,60)); label(&quot;A&quot;,(-52,-39),SW); label(&quot;B&quot;,(25,60),NE); label(&quot;C&quot;,(39,-52),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"242\" height=\"252\" />\nBecause the triangle is inscribed, the sum of the minor arcs equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/9/cf9506d61661a7d046ee93b381ddb704684ffd15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.  Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b408203be33e574505f5839e40bc6d898baa4177.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x+75+2x+25+3x-22=360\\]\" width=\"265\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/73414bf35412e93496c0f7bcb59a69972b3f96b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6x+78=360\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />\nSolving this yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26af3b2005bb4e27ae788301d5dec26cb543adbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, so the inscribed angles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/8240eb255c104c56bc0db366f8297f04dd5b368a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$122^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/1/2312f5dc20956a9533d5d822e7ae7158121f1a6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$99^\\circ$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e2d201d66717e1e6b7d0dc32824b96d982fe1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$119^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />.  Noting that an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is half of its corresponding inscribed angle, so the angles of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e505b973bcc5cb0bf1f464cf820b87e570c473e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$59.5^\\circ$\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5173389ba12d27db8842ce9db117b6d199bc5e54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49.5^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835538f469fb6a445257f6751e6250a3355cd4ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 61^\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"73\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017024101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 210/1000000\nPost‐expand inc